# A short drag of Tasks' content lets the keyboard go, wherever you type in Tasks:
# ANSWERS=scripts/duo-markdown.json HEX=kept scripts/duo tap <ref> scripts/duo-keyboard-taps
launch hexvoice:///?tasks=md
wait 3
tap ask-card
wait 1
tap Write your own
type ask-input typed
above-keyboard ask-input
scroll ask-card
wait 1
no-keyboard after a drag of the page
shoot page-dragged
launch hexvoice:///?tasks
wait 3
tap tasks-search
type tasks-search-field voice
above-keyboard tasks-search-field
scroll voiceapp
wait 1
no-keyboard after a drag of the list
shoot list-dragged
